European Union. Based on a cost analysis, the profitability of this
type of treatment was determined, resulting in a cost of 52.02 USD for
the control samples, T1 and T4, and 53.94 USD for the inductions T2,
T3, T5 and T6. Conclusions: The inclusion of the microorganisms
contributed to the decrease of cadmium content in the cocoa samples.
